      "id": 47602635,
      "by": "matthewmoss",
      "text": "Locket | <a href=\"https:&#x2F;&#x2F;locketcamera.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">https:&#x2F;&#x2F;locketcamera.com</a> | Hybrid, San Francisco + Remote | Full-time<p>Locket is the fastest-growing social app among Gen Alpha and Gen Z.<p>What if social media actually made you happier? Unlike other platforms focused on entertainment and endless scrolling, Locket helps you connect with the people who really matter: your best friends.<p>- 10M DAU, 100M downloads, $10M+ annual run rate<p>- Help define how AI fits into social media<p>- Ship to 10s of millions of active users from day one<p>- Scale the defining social app for the next generation<p>We’re hiring:<p>- Backend engineers<p>- Social media manager<p>Learn more and apply here: <a href=\"https:&#x2F;&#x2F;locket.camera&#x2F;jobs\" rel=\"nofollow\">https:&#x2F;&#x2F;locket.camera&#x2F;jobs</a>"
