      "id": 47610050,
      "by": "vishakhhegde",
      "text": "Inventive.ai (YC S23) | Senior Fullstack Engineer | Mountain View, CA | Hybrid | AI for PreSales | Growing rapidly<p>Our mission is to build intelligence that helps B2B sales teams win deals. Our first product is a suite of AI agents for sales teams that helps create winning proposals and RFP responses for $1.4 Trillion dollar industry.<p>Our founding team is from Google Deepmind, Stanford, UC Berkeley,  and IIT.  We were part of Y-Combinator S2023.<p>JD | Apply: <a href=\"https:&#x2F;&#x2F;inventiv.notion.site&#x2F;Senior-Full-Stack-Product-Engineer-b7ac41eb952441bc92f3040512fdb034\" rel=\"nofollow\">https:&#x2F;&#x2F;inventiv.notion.site&#x2F;Senior-Full-Stack-Product-Engin...</a><p>Website: <a href=\"https:&#x2F;&#x2F;inventive.ai\">https:&#x2F;&#x2F;inventive.ai</a>"
