      "id": 47606350,
      "by": "engteamatria",
      "text": "Atria | Global Remote (almost anywhere) &amp; Hybrid NYC | 10 Engineering roles\nAtria Health (<a href=\"https:&#x2F;&#x2F;www.atria.org\" rel=\"nofollow\">https:&#x2F;&#x2F;www.atria.org</a>) | product eng, devops eng, platform eng, ...<p>Our team is operating with the special combination of rigor, empathy, and innovation required to fuel a global shift from reactive sick care to preventative, precision healthcare.<p>Technologies: Express, React, GCP, Terraform, DBT, MySQL, Snowflake<p>Apply here: <a href=\"https:&#x2F;&#x2F;apply.workable.com&#x2F;atria-health&#x2F;\" rel=\"nofollow\">https:&#x2F;&#x2F;apply.workable.com&#x2F;atria-health&#x2F;</a><p>A human will read every resume sent to hackernewshiring@atria.org<p>------------------<p>P.S: We have a new role coming up: Staff SWE, Agentic AI. This role will drive the vision and implementation of agentic AI across our engineering, product, and design teams and later our broader company (clinicians, hospitality teams, ...). This is a special role where we&#x27;re looking for someone with a strong engineering background who is on the frontier of agentic development. Please express interest via email."
