      "text": "Honey Homes | Early Engineer (Full-Stack &#x2F; AI) | REMOTE (US) | Full-time<p>We make homeownership effortless by pairing homeowners with a dedicated handyman and building the software that runs the home.<p>We&#x27;re a small team with a product that&#x27;s growing quickly, and we&#x27;re backed by top investors. If you like building end-to-end systems with real-world impact, come join us.<p>Please get in touch at: <a href=\"https:&#x2F;&#x2F;jobs.ashbyhq.com&#x2F;Honey%20Homes&#x2F;b3cdd2cd-ffde-41f6-b820-465ce44b3942\" rel=\"nofollow\">https:&#x2F;&#x2F;jobs.ashbyhq.com&#x2F;Honey%20Homes&#x2F;b3cdd2cd-ffde-41f6-b8...</a>"
