      "text": "RepSpark | Engineering | REMOTE (US) | Full-Time | <a href=\"https:&#x2F;&#x2F;www.repspark.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">https:&#x2F;&#x2F;www.repspark.com</a><p>RepSpark is the top SaaS B2B wholesale e-commerce platform for brands in apparel, footwear, and accessories. For example, we&#x27;re how golf courses across North America and Europe purchase brands like Titleist, Peter Millar, Kjus, etc.<p>Stack: GraphQL, React, TypeScript, PostgreSQL, AWS<p>We&#x27;re actively hiring:<p>* Senior Product Engineer, Front-End: Own customer-facing product work end-to-end in React&#x2F;TypeScript, turning complex B2B e-commerce workflows into fast, accessible interfaces while helping modernize our legacy app — <a href=\"https:&#x2F;&#x2F;apply.appone.com&#x2F;job&#x2F;69cd53910f5e0e111fb5f819\" rel=\"nofollow\">https:&#x2F;&#x2F;apply.appone.com&#x2F;job&#x2F;69cd53910f5e0e111fb5f819</a>"
