      "id": 47603424,
      "by": "ratzo",
      "text": "Treatment Technologies &amp; Insights, Inc. (TTI) | Backend Engineers (Junior &amp; Senior) | El Segundo, CA | Hybrid<p>TTI is a fast-growing, mission-driven healthtech company building an ePRO (electronic patient-reported outcomes) platform for patients managing chronic conditions, with a focus on oncology. We&#x27;re a small, focused team where engineers have real platform ownership and direct impact on patient care.<p>We&#x27;re hiring two backend engineers to help scale our core platform:<p>Junior Backend Engineer - solid foundation in PHP&#x2F;Laravel&#x2F;MySQL, eager to grow\nSenior Backend Engineer - deep experience with PHP, Laravel, and MySQL, with the confidence to lead technical decisions<p>Both roles are hybrid, based in El Segundo, CA.<p>Apply here: <a href=\"https:&#x2F;&#x2F;job-boards.greenhouse.io&#x2F;ttiinc\" rel=\"nofollow\">https:&#x2F;&#x2F;job-boards.greenhouse.io&#x2F;ttiinc</a>"
