      "text": "Addepar&#x2F; Softare Engineering Manager&#x2F; NYC-Hybrid&#x2F; Full-time<p>Addepar is hiring a Software Engineering Manager for our New Workflow Platform team. We are pivoting from a SaaS suite to a global orchestration platform. We’re looking for a hands-on leader with 2+ years of management experience and a deep understanding of workflow technologies such as Temporal, n8n, Pipedream and Distributed Systems. Lead a team of Senior Staff engineers building the &quot;Agentic Fabric&quot; of the financial world.\nHybrid | NYC | Python&#x2F;Java | Temporal Cloud<p>Job description: <a href=\"https:&#x2F;&#x2F;job-boards.greenhouse.io&#x2F;addepar1&#x2F;jobs&#x2F;8460804002\" rel=\"nofollow\">https:&#x2F;&#x2F;job-boards.greenhouse.io&#x2F;addepar1&#x2F;jobs&#x2F;8460804002</a><p>Please email me directly: douglas.clifford@addepar.com"
