      "text": "Neon Health | AI in healthcare | Hiring Eng, Product &amp; Growth | SF, Remote (North America)<p>- Senior Backend Engineer | SF, Remote (North America) | Full-time | $170-225k + equity\n- Product Manager | SF | Full-time | $121-177k + equity\n- Account Exec | SF | Full-time | $120-350k + equity\n- Growth Specialist | SF | Full-time | $105-$137k + equity<p><a href=\"https:&#x2F;&#x2F;neonhealth.com&#x2F;\" rel=\"nofollow\">https:&#x2F;&#x2F;neonhealth.com&#x2F;</a><p>We’re mission-driven capitalists: making life-saving drugs more accessible, and building a $200B+ company on the scale of Palantir or ServiceNow.<p>Traction: profitable and growing fast. Landing 7+ figure contracts to enterprise healthcare customers.<p>Team: built by exited founders, YC &amp; MIT alum, ex-Tesla, ex-Google engineers.<p>Top investors: funded by elite Silicon Valley VCs who&#x27;ve backed unicorns like DoorDash, Lyft, and Mammoth Biosciences. And strategic healthcare investors with deep industry connections.<p>Outsized impact &amp; opportunity: work at the intersection of agentic AI, healthcare transformation, and life-changing patient outcomes.<p>If you want to work on a team of A-player athletes, doing the best work of your career, and helping get life-saving drugs to the people who need them, apply here:<p><a href=\"https:&#x2F;&#x2F;neonhealth.com&#x2F;careers\" rel=\"nofollow\">https:&#x2F;&#x2F;neonhealth.com&#x2F;careers</a> (and make sure to mention HN!)"
