      "id": 47610945,
      "by": "iamarsibragimov",
      "text": "Remote or Netherlands<p>Topliner - Founding Engineer (AI x Executive Search OS) - Remote - $80k + Equity\n<a href=\"https:&#x2F;&#x2F;topliner.app\" rel=\"nofollow\">https:&#x2F;&#x2F;topliner.app</a><p>We’re building an AI Operating System for executive search.<p>Not a typical dev role - we’re looking for someone who builds products, thinks in systems, and owns outcomes end-to-end.<p>Tech: Node.js, Laravel, React + TypeScript, AI workflows<p>Compensation: $80k&#x2F;year + Equity<p>Apply &gt;&gt;&gt; <a href=\"https:&#x2F;&#x2F;t.me&#x2F;iamarsenibragimov\" rel=\"nofollow\">https:&#x2F;&#x2F;t.me&#x2F;iamarsenibragimov</a>"
